# introduction to C Programming

Ready to dive into C programming? This repository is your go-to resource for mastering the fundamentals. Whether you're just starting out or looking to strengthen your programming skills, you'll find hands-on examples and clear explanations to get you coding confidently.

What you'll learn:
- Structure of a C program
- Data types and variables
- Input and output using printf and scanf
- Operators and expressions
- Conditional statements (if, if-else, switch)
- Loops (for, while, do-while)
- Functions and modular programming
- Arrays and strings
- Pointers and basic memory concepts
- Real-world problem solving with practical examples
